<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Brenner Mills yr shr flat, no div.</title>
<headline>Brenner Mills yr shr flat, no div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended February 28</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)    24.0	vs    24.6</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		  8.34	vs    8.80</p>
<p>    Tax			2.75	vs    3.07</p>
<p>Interest received</p>
<p>    (paid)		   0.74	vs   (0.83)</p>
<p>    Turnover	     128.89	vs  137.77</p>
<p>Full name: Brenner Mills Limited</p>
<p>NOTE - A special resolution will be proposed at the annual general meeting to be held on July 23 to return to shareholders registered on that date an amount of 15 cents per share which is to be charged against the share premium account. In view of this distribution, no dividends have been declared for the year, the company said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
